much never too young,

00:21:51.277 --> 00:21:53.010
honestly, like, just start.

00:21:53.010 --> 00:21:54.850
I mean, you know, kids
are smarter than you,

00:21:54.850 --> 00:21:56.999
so go you know, don't use jargon.

