00:21:59.790 --> 00:22:02.800
But I think, you know, one of
the big changes in education,

00:22:02.800 --> 00:22:04.820
I wonder if you agree Sal

00:22:04.820 --> 00:22:07.380
is, well, I hope it's a
change in education is that,

00:22:07.380 --> 00:22:08.520
you know, we're I'm not saying

00:22:08.520 --> 00:22:10.450
that like the student and the teacher

00:22:10.450 --> 00:22:12.770
are interchangeable and there's no reason

00:22:12.770 --> 00:22:14.690
why we even have to, I'm not saying that.

00:22:14.690 --> 00:22:17.360
I'm just saying that students
are remarkably perceptive

00:22:17.360 --> 00:22:20.580
and intelligent and they can
understand when you say like,

00:22:20.580 --> 00:22:21.940
this is why we're doing this.

00:22:21.940 --> 00:22:24.220
Like the, you know, the scope and sequence

00:22:24.220 --> 00:22:25.053
