00:23:19.469 --> 00:23:22.707
That automation and even some you know,

00:23:22.707 --> 00:23:24.123
it was gonna make labor.

00:23:24.123 --> 00:23:24.956
- Artificial intelligence right.

00:23:24.956 --> 00:23:25.789
- Artificial intelligence,
- Yeah.

00:23:25.789 --> 00:23:27.790
- Robotics, so you wanna
be able to participate

00:23:27.790 --> 00:23:30.070
