00:23:39.620 --> 00:23:41.490
he went to his room and like,

00:23:41.490 --> 00:23:43.370
she didn't see him for another hour.

00:23:43.370 --> 00:23:44.310
And like, she went in the room,

00:23:44.310 --> 00:23:45.143
