00:25:09.220 --> 00:25:10.940
They are able to go on vacations.

00:25:10.940 --> 00:25:13.810
They go to restaurants, they
don't reuse paper towels.

00:25:13.810 --> 00:25:15.670
Like that's the life I want.

00:25:15.670 --> 00:25:17.380
I still reuse paper
towels every now and then,

00:25:17.380 --> 00:25:18.683
but that's the life I want.

00:25:18.683 --> 00:25:21.650
But you know, you oftentimes worry about,

00:25:21.650 --> 00:25:24.170
I think kids who grow up middle class

00:25:24.170 --> 00:25:26.664
