00:29:41.120 --> 00:29:44.750
And like they, they update
me and correct me when they

00:29:44.750 --> 00:29:46.240
think that that's needed.

00:29:46.240 --> 00:29:48.220
So then the question is how do we channel

00:29:48.220 --> 00:29:51.403
all that adolescent, you know,
purpose driven motivation.

00:29:51.403 --> 00:29:54.420
And I think one real challenge
