00:35:44.580 --> 00:35:46.380
- So I'll just give one suggestion.

00:35:46.380 --> 00:35:48.610
And that is this intuition that you have,

00:35:48.610 --> 00:35:51.374
the big thing it needs to be
broken up into small things

00:35:51.374 --> 00:35:52.754
