00:35:56.430 --> 00:35:58.890
by Al Bandura at Stanford.

00:35:58.890 --> 00:35:59.883
Now many years ago

00:35:59.883 --> 00:36:03.000
where he actually had
elementary school kids

00:36:03.000 --> 00:36:05.850
who were learning math
